<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Inventory, Batches &amp; Compounds</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Medicine stock that actually matches what left the shelf — FEFO deduction on every
            dispense, expiry visibility on the Command Center, and compound recipes that print
            clean label text at the till.
        </p>
    </div>
